# OcarinaShell (fase 13, D-068): the boot theme follows the desktop theme. Installed by scripts/root/arranque-auto.sh
# with @HOME@ replaced. theme.json is replaced atomically by ocarina-theme (rename): PathChanged catches it.
[Unit]
Description=OcarinaShell · watch the theme for the boot chain

[Path]
PathChanged=@HOME@/.local/state/ocarinashell/theme.json
Unit=ocarina-boot-sync.service

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
